{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22019","headline":"读史五首 五 · 白居易","name":"读史五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季子顦顇时，妇见不下机。\n买臣负薪日，妻亦弃如遗。\n一朝黄金多，佩印衣锦归。\n去妻不敢视，妇嫂强依依。\n富贵家人重，贫贱妻子欺。\n奈何贫富间，可移亲爱志。\n遂使中人心，汲汲求富贵。\n又令下人力，各竞锥刀利。\n随分归舍来，一取妻孥意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}